b. Building materials not located on a building site subject to a valid city issued building permit;
c. Carpet, rugs, or any other interior flooring coverings;
d. Motor vehicle components or parts, including tires and wheels;
e. Lawnmowers, weed eaters, chainsaws, leaf blowers, and other yard equipment;
f. Home appliances, whether minor or major, including, but not limited to, air conditioners, dishwashers, clothes dryers, washing machines, ovens and stoves, microwave ovens, induction cookers, refrigerators, or freezers;
g. Household electrical devices, including, but not limited to, computers, monitors, televisions, and stereo equipment; and
